  "notes": "A farm pen in the water, 13 m by 9 m: silver driftwood posts down to the bed, a plank catwalk with a rail round the edge 1.5 m above the sea, and a cross walk splitting it. The west half holds three rows of oyster racks with mesh bags; the east half is an open pen of six 4 m mooring posts with iron rings. Base sea, front local -Z.",
